  "description": "Yeon-U is a genius composer known for creating only sad music. With a concert right around the corner and an unfinished composition, not to mention a scandal erupting, he flees to the countryside to focus on his work. While borrowing a piano at his nephew's music academy, he reunites with his first love, who guided him into the world of piano. Yeon-U, who has always been blunt and rarely smiled, finds himself creating warm and lovely music unlike his previous compositions, all thanks to the cheerful Eun-Seong. Can their meeting inspire a new, heartwarming melody?! \n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)",
